== Trivia ==
* {{dlc+|r}} When {{c|Tainted Forgotten}} dies and respawns using this item, the resulting {{c|Lazarus Risen}} appears as a skin-colored pile of bones with Lazarus' head on top. This is purely visual and Lazarus Risen is still able to move and shoot as normal. This was originally a bug, but was left in because the developer Kilburn found it funny.<ref>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yP-g4AYNuY</ref>{{dlc-}}
** All characters, except {{c|Azazel}}, {{c|The Lost}}, and {{c|Tainted Lost}}, have this bone-pile form. They can be seen if {{i|Clicker}} is used as bone-pile Lazarus to turn into another character.

